Invesco Announces Third Quarter Diluted EPS of $0.71; Adjusted Diluted EPS(1) of $0.77

ATLANTA, Oct. 26, 2021 /PRNewswire/ -- Invesco Ltd. (NYSE: IVZ) today reported financial results for the three months ended September 30, 2021. (PRNewsfoto/Invesco Ltd.)

$13.3 billion of net long-term inflows, continued strength in our Fixed Income capabilities, ETF franchise, Private Markets and Greater China $1,528.6 billion in ending AUM, an increase of 0.2% over the prior quarter 26.5% operating margin;
